She knows about Arcadia.

1046
01:15:13,215 --> 01:15:14,149
She knows about everything.

1047
01:15:14,182 --> 01:15:15,450
- What happened?

1048
01:15:15,484 --> 01:15:17,119
- Bad things.

1049
01:15:17,152 --> 01:15:18,420
We have a slight problem.

1050
01:15:18,453 --> 01:15:21,656
- All right, but let's
get you both inside.

1051
01:15:25,560 --> 01:15:27,262
- Nic.
- Shh.

1052
01:15:28,363 --> 01:15:29,931
I didn't leave that open.

1053
01:16:18,880 --> 01:16:21,249
Hey, look.

1054
01:16:28,857 --> 01:16:30,292
- That's that stuff.

1055
01:16:31,159 --> 01:16:32,160
His blood.

1056
01:16:59,555 --> 01:17:00,722
- Wait!

1057
01:17:02,691 --> 01:17:04,693
Nic, it's me.

1058
01:17:06,161 --> 01:17:07,829
- No, no, no.

1059
01:17:10,065 --> 01:17:13,101
- No, you're dead.
You're dead.

1060
01:17:13,135 --> 01:17:14,836
I'm fucking crazy.

1061
01:17:14,870 --> 01:17:16,671
- You're not crazy, Nic.

1062
01:17:16,705 --> 01:17:17,839
- This isn't real.

1063
01:17:17,873 --> 01:17:21,009
You died in a hospital.
I was there.

1064
01:17:21,042 --> 01:17:23,111
- Life, death,

1065
01:17:24,446 --> 01:17:28,049
to Lycaon it is but a game.

1066
01:17:28,717 --> 01:17:30,385
I was dying, Nic.

1067
01:17:31,219 --> 01:17:32,821
I didn't want to leave.

1068
01:17:32,854 --> 01:17:34,756
I knew there was a way.

1069
01:17:34,789 --> 01:17:40,028
I knew the great wolf-Lord
Lycaon could offer more time.

1070
01:17:40,061 --> 01:17:42,664
But there's too much of
a price to pay,

1071
01:17:42,697 --> 01:17:44,432
watching you from the shadows.

1072
01:17:45,667 --> 01:17:49,605
What can be summoned,
can surely be banished.

1073
01:17:49,639 --> 01:17:51,239
No, it's not too late.

1074
01:17:51,273 --> 01:17:53,408
You have that blood pyramid.

1075
01:17:54,476 --> 01:17:56,745
It's what drew him to our world,

1076
01:17:56,778 --> 01:17:58,880
and it is what can
send him back.

1077
01:17:59,615 --> 01:18:01,316
I'm bound to him now.

1078
01:18:02,250 --> 01:18:05,887
My blood is one with the
Lord of Wolves.

1079
01:18:08,524 --> 01:18:12,160
- Nicholas, your
time has come.

1080
01:18:12,194 --> 01:18:14,597
- I want to make a deal
with you, Lycaon.

1081
01:18:14,630 --> 01:18:16,698
I want you to let
these people go.

1082
01:18:16,731 --> 01:18:18,967
Sean, Albert.
They're not monsters.

1083
01:18:19,000 --> 01:18:21,136
- Oh, but they are, Nicholas.

1084
01:18:21,169 --> 01:18:24,739
It's the city that drives
them to this extreme.

1085
01:18:24,773 --> 01:18:27,442
We must transform to live.

1086
01:18:27,475 --> 01:18:28,810
- We're fine with how we are.

1087
01:18:28,843 --> 01:18:31,947
- What do you see when you
close your eyes, Nicholas?

1088
01:18:32,948 --> 01:18:38,753
I'm there waiting in your
blackest dreams.

1089
01:18:38,787 --> 01:18:40,255
I can help you.

1090
01:18:40,288 --> 01:18:42,791
I can make sure nothing
stands in your way.

1091
01:18:42,824 --> 01:18:44,793
- I can do that without you.

1092
01:18:44,826 --> 01:18:47,395
- You're weak, Nicholas.

1093
01:18:47,429 --> 01:18:49,665
Nicholas.

1094
01:18:49,699 --> 01:18:51,800
- You're all so weak,

1095
01:18:51,833 --> 01:18:54,469
so lost and alone.

1096
01:18:54,502 --> 01:18:56,672
That's what brought you to me.

1097
01:18:56,706 --> 01:18:59,074
- When Sean was on the
tracks that night,

1098
01:18:59,107 --> 01:19:00,909
I was the one who stopped him.

1099
01:19:00,942 --> 01:19:03,713
When Albert got his
diagnosis, I was there.

1100
01:19:03,745 --> 01:19:07,015
When he died, it was me
that was at the hospital.

1101
01:19:07,048 --> 01:19:11,353
See, we're not all alone.

1102
01:19:11,386 --> 01:19:12,921
We don't need to join you.

1103
01:19:12,954 --> 01:19:15,890
- They've done terrible
things and you will too.

1104
01:19:15,924 --> 01:19:18,960
Think of all the days and
weeks and years

1105
01:19:18,994 --> 01:19:20,630
you felt so lonely.

1106
01:19:20,663 --> 01:19:22,565
- No.

1107
01:19:22,598 --> 01:19:25,735
- The dying old man
with company,

1108
01:19:25,767 --> 01:19:29,237
but a cancer ate him from
the inside out.

1109
01:19:30,405 --> 01:19:32,407
- Beth, Sean.

1110
01:19:34,209 --> 01:19:37,546
- Everyone let you believe you
were destined for greatness.

1111
01:19:37,580 --> 01:19:41,249
Life is simply one
disappointment after the next.

1112
01:19:41,283 --> 01:19:43,619
It's dull, Nicholas.

1113
01:19:43,653 --> 01:19:46,054
I can show you a better way

1114
01:19:46,087 --> 01:19:48,456
and everything you want
you will take.

1115
01:19:48,490 --> 01:19:50,125
- You took my sister, you fuck!

1116
01:19:52,027 --> 01:19:54,730
- Oh, sad little Sean.

1117
01:19:54,764 --> 01:19:56,998
Your sister made her own way.

1118
01:19:57,032 --> 01:19:59,067
Your parents turned
their backs on you.

1119
01:19:59,100 --> 01:20:01,604
Kirsty turned her back on you.

1120
01:20:01,637 --> 01:20:03,071
What they didn't know is that

1121
01:20:03,104 --> 01:20:05,708
you turned your back on
yourself a long time ago.

1122
01:20:05,741 --> 01:20:06,975
- Don't listen to him.

1123
01:20:07,008 --> 01:20:10,812
- And how could you not when
there's so much to hate?

1124
01:20:10,845 --> 01:20:13,848
So much selfishness,
so much self-pity.

1125
01:20:13,882 --> 01:20:15,016
- You're wrong.

1126
01:20:15,483 --> 01:20:16,585
That's not me.

1127
01:20:16,619 --> 01:20:18,987
- Oh, but it is, Sean.

1128
01:20:19,020 --> 01:20:22,057
As your sister lays shivering
and dying in the streets,

1129
01:20:22,090 --> 01:20:25,493
in the gutters, you
indulged yourself.

1130
01:20:25,528 --> 01:20:26,562
- No.

1131
01:20:26,595 --> 01:20:28,330
- You let her die.

1132
01:20:28,363 --> 01:20:29,197
- No.

1133
01:20:29,230 --> 01:20:31,466
- She needed you and you
weren't there.

1134
01:20:32,400 --> 01:20:34,035
You never were.

1135
01:20:35,370 --> 01:20:37,339
- Stay away from him!

1136
01:20:37,372 --> 01:20:39,307
- Oh, Bethany.

1137
01:20:39,341 --> 01:20:41,209
So misunderstood.

1138
01:20:41,242 --> 01:20:44,379
The world took you for
a timid little fool.

1139
01:20:44,412 --> 01:20:46,682
But I knew you were
greater than them.

1140
01:20:46,716 --> 01:20:47,750
I empowered you.

1141
01:20:47,783 --> 01:20:49,719
- You made me evil.

1142
01:20:49,752 --> 01:20:52,320
- Every drop spilled the
pain went away.

1143
01:20:52,354 --> 01:20:54,657
- But it didn't,
it only made it worse.

1144
01:20:54,690 --> 01:20:55,990
- Worse?

1145
01:20:56,024 --> 01:20:58,694
So what if I let him live?

1146
01:20:58,728 --> 01:21:00,730
How many more after-work visits

1147
01:21:00,763 --> 01:21:02,665
could you have handled
before it broke you?

1148
01:21:02,698 --> 01:21:04,432
- I'm gonna stand up for myself.

1149
01:21:04,466 --> 01:21:07,435
If people hurt me, I'm
gonna hold them accountable.

1150
01:21:07,469 --> 01:21:12,273
- Don't forget that you are
pathetic little mouse, Bethany.

1151
01:21:12,307 --> 01:21:14,844
But I turned you into a lioness.

1152
01:21:14,876 --> 01:21:18,748
Lioness that belongs
to me for all eternity.

1153
01:21:18,781 --> 01:21:21,116
- Leave us alone!

1154
01:22:12,535 --> 01:22:16,137
- <i>That was the</i>
<i>last time I saw Lycaon.</i>

1155
01:22:16,171 --> 01:22:18,507
<i>By now the whole thing</i>
<i>feels like a dream.</i>

1156
01:22:21,042 --> 01:22:23,679
<i>But I still feel them</i>

1157
01:22:23,712 --> 01:22:26,749
<i>watching us all from the</i>
<i>shadows and empty streets.</i>

1158
01:22:29,350 --> 01:22:32,521
<i>Keeping friends in this</i>
<i>city is tough.</i>

1159
01:22:32,555 --> 01:22:36,024
<i>Sean and Beth left just</i>
<i>as suddenly as they came.</i>

1160
01:22:38,326 --> 01:22:40,061
<i>Nobody sticks around for long.</i>

1161
01:22:40,629 --> 01:22:42,063
<i>How could they?</i>

1162
01:22:45,500 --> 01:22:48,303
<i>People looked,</i>
<i>especially the police,</i>

1163
01:22:48,336 --> 01:22:50,606
<i>but I don't think they</i>
<i>ever found them.</i>

1164
01:22:53,274 --> 01:22:56,679
<i>Let all the dark things that</i>
<i>happened here be forgotten.</i>

1165
01:22:56,712 --> 01:22:59,682
<i>Left alone until some poor</i>
<i>soul finds them again.</i>

1166
01:23:02,518 --> 01:23:05,521
<i>I'm just happy knowing</i>
<i>it won't be me.</i>

